t":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொள்","tr":"koḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளா","tr":"ḷā"}]},{"text":"தோனே","tr":"tōṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"இல்லா","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"non-existent"},{"surface":"கியரோ","parts":[{"text":"கியரோ","lemma":"கியரோ","gloss":"may they become indeed"}],"gloss":"may they become indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலை","gloss":"morning"}],"gloss":"mornings"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evenings"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அல்லா","parts":[{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"not being"},{"surface":"கியர்","parts":[{"text":"கியர்","lemma":"கியர்","gloss":"may they become"}],"gloss":"may they become","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"வாழும்","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்","lemma":"வாழ்","gloss":"live"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"living"},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"days indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நடுகல்","parts":[{"text":"நடு","lemma":"நடு","gloss":"erect"},{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"stone"}],"gloss":"hero-stone"},{"surface":"பீலி","parts":[{"text":"பீலி","lemma":"பீலி","gloss":"peacock feather"}],"gloss":"peacock feathers"},{"surface":"சூட்டி","parts":[{"text":"சூட்டு","lemma":"சூட்டு","gloss":"adorn"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having adorned"},{"surface":"நார்அரி","parts":[{"text":"நார்","lemma":"நார்","gloss":"fiber"},{"text":"அரி","lemma":"அரி","gloss":"filtered liquor"}],"gloss":"fiber-filtered liquor"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சிறுகலத்து","parts":[{"text":"சிறுகலத்து","lemma":"சிறுகலத்து","gloss":"in the small vessel"}],"gloss":"in the small vessel","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உகுப்பவும்","parts":[{"text":"உகு","lemma":"உகு","gloss":"pour"},{"text":"ப்ப","lemma":"ப்ப","gloss":"future/infinitival suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even when poured"},{"surface":"கொள்வன்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"accept"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"future tense marker"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"will he accept"},{"surface":"கொல்லொ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்லொ","lemma":"கொல்லொ","gloss":"wondering if"}],"gloss":"wondering if","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கோடு","parts":[{"text":"கோடு","lemma":"கோடு","gloss":"peak"}],"gloss":"peaks"},{"surface":"உயர்","parts":[{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"உயர்","gloss":"be high"}],"gloss":"lofty"},{"surface":"பிறங்குமலை","parts":[{"text":"பிறங்கு","lemma":"பிறங்கு","gloss":"shine"},{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"shining mountains"},{"surface":"கெழீஇய","parts":[{"text":"கெழீஇய","lemma":"கெழீஇய","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாடு","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"country"}],"gloss":"countries"},{"surface":"உடன்","parts":[{"text":"உடன்","lemma":"உடன்","gloss":"together"}],"gloss":"entirely"},{"surface":"கொடுப்புவும்","parts":[{"text":"கொடு","lemma":"கொடு","gloss":"give"},{"text":"ப்பு","lemma":"ப்பு","gloss":"noun-forming suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even when given"},{"surface":"கொள்ளா","parts":[{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"accept"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"not"}],"gloss":"not accepting"},{"surface":"தோனே","parts":[{"text":"தோனே","lemma":"தோனே","gloss":"he indeed"}],"gloss":"he indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"May they become non-existent, mornings and evenings! / May they become not, the days that I live! / Adorning the hero-stone with peacock feathers, even when poured in a small vessel, fiber-filtered liquor, will he accept? / He who, even when entire countries with lofty-peaked shining mountains were given, did not accept!","translation":"May mornings and evenings cease to exist! May the remaining days of my life come to an end! Will he, who refused to accept entire kingdoms with high-peaked, shining mountains when offered to him, now accept the simple offering of fiber-filtered liquor poured into a small cup before his hero-stone adorned with peacock feathers?","modern":"காலைப்பொழுதும் மாலைப்பொழுதும் இல்லாமல் போகட்டும்! நான் வாழும் நாட்களும் முடிந்து போகட்டும்! உயர்ந்த சிகரங்களை உடைய விளங்கும் மலைகளோடு கூடிய நாடுகளை எல்லாம் பரிசாகக் கொடுத்தாலும் ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளாத என் தலைவன், இப்போது நடுகல்லாய் நின்று, மயில் தோகை சூட்டப்பட்டு, சிறிய கலயத்தில் ஊற்றப்படும் நார் அரித்த கள்ளினை ஏற்றுக்கொள்வானோ?","explanation":"This poignant poem is composed by the famous poetess Avvaiyār, mourning the death of her patron, the chieftain Atiyamāṉ Neṭumāṉ Añci. The poem belongs to the tumpai tiṇai, which traditionally deals with battle and heroism, and specifically the theme of pāṇpāṭṭu (the song of the bard/mourning). Avvaiyār expresses her deep grief, wishing that her own days would end because the world has lost its meaning without her patron. She contrasts Atiyamāṉ's grand, generous nature in life—where he refused to accept entire kingdoms offered to him—with his current state as a silent hero-stone (naṭukal). She wonders with heartbreaking irony if he will now accept the humble offering of filtered liquor poured into a small vessel at his memorial stone. Key words include naṭukal (hero-stone), pīli (peacock feathers), and koḷḷātōṉē (he who did not accept).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}